specs/story-spine/README.md:5:Everything the game has is already a story — it just doesn't INTRODUCE itself. The spine turns the existing systems into a told tale: a player who knows nothing gets guided, beat by beat, from a nameless riverbank to facing the Baron and building the Steamworks — by CHARACTERS, not tooltips.
